        "email": "michael@bentleypc.com",
        "company": "BentleyPC LLC"
      }
    ],
    "releaseDate": "11/16/2026",
    "description": "Collects Linux hwmon (lm-sensors class) board telemetry on BMC-less hosts via /sys/class/hwmon - no ipmitool or lm-sensors dependency. Emits sensor readings as JSON events to index=main (sourcetype sensors:status) and numeric sensor metrics to index=metrics (sourcetype sensors:metrics, sensors.* metrics), with overview and metrics dashboards.",
